[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3950019701","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116622#issuecomment-3950019701","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116622","id":3950019701,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rcIR1","user":{"login":"MattiaZir","id":5838871,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4Mzg4NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5838871?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir","html_url":"https://github.com/MattiaZir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-24T08:28:38Z","updated_at":"2026-02-24T08:28:38Z","body":"> I just tested this, and, unfortunately, I think it needs some changes\r\n> \r\n> If you're using the default action map (which is huge), once you start typing in the field to (re)name an action, the entire editor grinds to a halt, because it's resaving the entire action map on every key press\r\n> \r\n> This should try to be a bit smarter about emiting the signal that an action has been renamed. Perhaps it could (a) debounce the keypress (ie only emit the signal after the user has stopped typing for a certain amount of time), or (b) only emit the signal after the `LineEdit` becomes unfocused (so when the user clicks into some other control)\r\n\r\nThank you for testing and pointing that out!\r\nI like your second solution, I'll implement it ASAP but I expect that the editor will still freeze after the unfocus if a big enough profile is used.\r\nAt least it will freeze once and not every time the user types something in the LineEdit.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3950019701/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3952289416","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116622#issuecomment-3952289416","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116622","id":3952289416,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rkyaI","user":{"login":"MattiaZir","id":5838871,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4Mzg4NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5838871?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir","html_url":"https://github.com/MattiaZir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattiaZir/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-24T14:21:29Z","updated_at":"2026-02-24T14:21:29Z","body":"I've implemented a boolean that acts as a dirty bit, otherwise it would've refreshed each time one of the name fields 